          "body": "```\n[31/51] Building C object CMakeFiles/sharkd.dir/sharkd_session.c.o\n../sharkd_session.c:289:10: warning: using the result of an assignment as a condition without parentheses [-Wparentheses]\n        if (ptr = g_strrstr(valid_param, \"*\"))\n            ~~~~^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n../sharkd_session.c:289:10: note: place parentheses around the assignment to silence this warning\n        if (ptr = g_strrstr(valid_param, \"*\"))\n                ^\n            (                                )\n../sharkd_session.c:289:10: note: use '==' to turn this assignment into an equality comparison\n        if (ptr = g_strrstr(valid_param, \"*\"))\n                ^\n                ==\n../sharkd_session.c:291:24: warning: implicit conversion loses integer precision: 'long' to 'int' [-Wshorten-64-to-32]\n                int prefix_len = ptr - valid_param;\n                    ~~~~~~~~~~   ~~~~^~~~~~~~~~~~~\n../sharkd_session.c:541:35: warning: passing 'const char *' to parameter of type 'char *' discards qualifiers [-Wincompatible-pointer-types-discards-qualifiers]\n                                if (is_param_match(attr_name, name_array[j].name) && name_array[j].level == level)\n                                                              ^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n../sharkd_session.c:285:38: note: passing argument to parameter 'valid_param' here\nis_param_match(char *param_in, char *valid_param)\n                                     ^\n3 warnings generated.\n```",
